  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MASSIF-P00015654-001</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the two tranches is to enable Banco FIE to provide financing to micro-, small- and medium-sized enterprises in Bolivia. With FMO&#x2019;s funds, Banco FIE will be able to offer more financial services to MSME entrepreneurs in urban, semi-urban, as well as rural areas. This is in line with Banco FIE&#x2019;s strategy to expand further into rural areas to maintain its leading position in the microfinance market.</narrative>
  </description>
